message: "Please cite this independent study; cite Agentic Real2Sim and DROID separately when using their components/data."
type: software
title: "Robot-Contact State Restoration: Velocity Omission Perturbs Contact Dynamics Without Changing Command Selection"
authors:
  - family-names: Wu
    given-names: Zhijing
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZhijingWu/robot-contact-state-restoration"
url: "https://github.com/ZhijingWu/robot-contact-state-restoration"
abstract: "Independent controlled simulation using Agentic Real2Sim components. State omissions changed physical trajectories but produced 0/16 command-choice flips in a fixed contact regime. No native converted-episode reproduction, real-robot validation, framework defect or algorithmic novelty is claimed."
keywords:
  - simulation state restoration
  - contact dynamics
  - negative results
  - reproducibility
